keywords = "Direction map ",
abstract = "Abstract This paper presents the unsupervised retinal vessels segmentation method, \{SEVERE\} (SEgmenting \{VEssels\} in \{REtina\} images), which is based on the direction map of retina scan images assigning each pixel one out of twelve discrete directions. \{SEVERE\} works on the green channel of \{RGB\} retina scan images. It does not require any pre-processing phase and all the computations are done exclusively on the direction map. \{SEVERE\} has been checked on publicly available datasets producing qualitatively satisfactory results and outperforming other existing methods in terms of quantitative performance evaluation parameters, such as accuracy and sensitivity. "
